      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if rediscovery is even possible though. it's not like i can just go back and rebuild it. the internet and everyone i knew moved on like i was never even here. it's just a void now. i feel like the version of me that mattered is just... extinct. and it's so exhausting trying to pretend there's something left to save when there really isn't.",
